sequenceDiagram
    actor S as Student
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI /api/comparisons/analyze
    participant DB as Database
    participant AST as AST Engine
    participant ML as ML Engine

    S->>FE: Select Submission A + B, click Analyze
    FE->>API: POST /api/comparisons/analyze (JWT)
    API->>DB: Fetch submissions owned by user
    DB-->>API: Submission A, Submission B
    API->>AST: parse + normalize + extract features (A, B)
    AST-->>API: features_a, features_b
    API->>AST: compute AST / token / cosine / TED similarity
    AST-->>API: similarity scores
    API->>ML: predict(code_a, code_b)
    ML-->>API: ml_score
    API->>API: compute weighted final_score, classify risk
    API->>DB: INSERT Comparison record
    DB-->>API: comparison.id
    API-->>FE: ComparisonDetail JSON (scores, explanation, code)
    FE-->>S: Render similarity gauge + breakdown + code view
